     H*****************************************************************
     H* INDICATOR USAGE:                                              *
     H*                                                               *
     H* XXPRT  SET TO ONE IF A DETAIL LINE HAS BEEN PRINTED           *
     H* OF  OVERFLOW INDICATOR                                        *
     H* 1-27 USED FOR INDICATING SUB-TOTALS ON THE PREMIUM LINES.     *
     H* 31  USED TO TEST IF RESULT OF A SUBTRACTION IS LESS THAN ZERO *
     H* 38  QUOTE ENVIRONMENT                                         *
     H* 39  RECALCULATE DEPOSIT WAS REQUESTED FROM PROMPT             *
     H* 40  GENERAL CHAIN (READ) INDICATOR                            *
     H* 41  CALCULATED DEPOSIT DUE IS GREATER THAN ZERO               *
     H* 42  CALCULATED DEPOSIT DUE IS LESS THAN ZERO                  *
     H* 43  DEPOSIT DUE PLUS EXP CONST DUE IS GREATER THAN ZERO       *
     H* 44  POLICY INVOKED MINIMUM PREMIUM                            *
     H* 48  INCREASED LIMIT IS NOT ZERO                               *
     H* 49  Stop Gap Premium title for client 148                     *
     H* 50  GENERAL CHAIN (READ) INDICATOR                            *
     H* 51  SET OFF IF 54 IS SET ON. DO NOT PRINT AMOUNTS ON BOTTOM   *
     H*     RIGHT HAND SIDE OF BILL                                   *
     H* 52  DO NOT PRINT MEMBERSHIP FEES DUE IF ZERO.                 *
     H* 53  DO NOT PRINT SAFETY FEES DUE IF ZERO.                     *
     H* 54  OVERFLOW REACHED,ELEVENTH PAYROLL RECORD READ             *
     H* 55  PRINT 1ST ASSESSMENT                                      *
     H* 56  PRINT 2ND ASSESSMENT                                      *
     H* 58  DISCOUNT ONE (CONTRACTOR'S CREDIT) IS ZERO                *
     H* 59  PRORATA EQUALS ONE                                        *
     H* 60  GENERAL CHAIN (READ) INDICATOR                            *
     H* 61  FIRST TIME INDICATOR                                      *
     H* 62  THERE IS AN ADDITIONAL LOAD VALUE ASSOCIATED WITH PAYROLL *
     H*     DETAIL LINE DISPLAYED ON BILL                             *
     H* 63  EMPLOYER DETAIL AUDIT FLAG IS EQUAL TO 'E' (NOT 'R'       *
     H*     OR 'A')' I.E. THIS IS AN ESTIMATED BILL                   *
     H* 65  FUND ADDRESS TWO IS NOT EQUAL TO BLANKS                   *
     H* 68  PRINT HARDCOPY - CONIDITION FOR QSYSPRT1 EXCPT STATEMENTS *
     H* 71 -                                                          *
     H* 82  DUE AMOUNT LINES 1-12 ON BOTTOM LEFT HAND SIDE OF BILL    *
     H*     ARE NOT EQUAL TO BLANKS                                   *
     H* 83  EMPLOYER DBA NOT BLANK                                    *
     H* 87  EMPLOYER DETAIL ANNIVERSARY RATING DATE IS NOT EQUAL TO   *
     H*     ZERO                                                      *
     H* 88  EMPLOYER DETAIL ANNIVERSARY RATING DATE IS NOT EQUAL TO   *
     H*     ZERO AND EMPLOYER DETAIL ANNIVERSARY RATING DATE + 1 YR   *
     H*     FALLS OUTSIDE EMPLOYER POLICY DATES                       *
     H* 89  INDICATOR 88 MUST BE SET AND                              *
     H*       EXPERIENCE MODIFIER ONE EFFECTIVE DATE MUST EQUAL       *
     H*         EMPLOYER DETAIL ANNIVERSARY RATING DATE (AND)         *
     H*       EXPERIENCE MODIFIER TWO EFFECTIVE DATE MUST EQUAL       *
     H*         EMPLOYER DETAIL ANNIVERSARY RATING DATE + 1 YR (AND)  *
     H*       EXPERIENCE MODIFIER VALUE ONE MUST NOT EQUAL EXPERIENCE *
     H*         MODIFIER VALUE TWO                                    *
     H* 91  FUND PHONE NUMBER EQUAL TO ZERO                           *
     H*****************************************************************
     FWABLL     UF   E           K DISK
