     C                   If        (ELEWAV <> 0 and XXMINF <> 'Y') OR
     C                             (MPEWAV <> 0 and XXMINF = 'Y')
      *** End Add *****  02/28/25  *******************************************
     C*
     C     RRWVHD        IFEQ      *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     CON(27)       HDG(A)
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     RRWVHD        HDG(A)
