     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     'Net  '       XXDEDT
     C                   ENDIF                                                  DDTYPE IFEQ
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     LDAMP1        XXAMPO
     C                   Z-ADD     LDAMG1        XXAMAG
     c                   endif                                                  ldpct1 <> 0
     c*
     c*  2nd Large Deductible Info
     c*
     c                   if        ldpct2 <> 0
     c                   move      *off          *in47
     C                   CLEAR                   XXDDVB
     c*
     C                   SELECT
     C     LDVRB2        WHENEQ    'C'
