     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDYY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         EXD(A)
     C     EFD(A)        IFNE      *ZERO
     C     EXD(A)        ANDNE     *ZERO
     C                   MOVE      '-'           DSH(A)
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  SRDTI IFNE
     C*
     C                   Select
     C*>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> Stabilization Factor
     C                   When      cltID = '025'
     C                   MOVE      ELSTFC        XXASP8            8
     C                   MOVEA     XXASP8        NUM8
      *
     C                   MOVE      NUM8(2)       PCT(1)
