     C                   Z-add     annMin        tasmin
     C                   Endif
     C                   Z-ADD     tasmin        TAM(A)
     C                   MOVE      '+'           SGN(A)
      *** Beg Add *****  05/12/25  *******************************************
      * Print an '*' appended to heading on the line item
       If ELPror > 0 and ELPror < 1;
          If (ELcofl <> 'Y' and xxst <> 'NJ');
             HDG(A) = %trim(HDG(A)) + '*';
             PrintFlg = 'Y';
          Endif;
       Endif;
      *** End Add *****  05/12/25  *******************************************
