     C     EAKYD         READE     PEA0D
     C                   ENDDO                                                  *IN60 DOWEQ *OFF
     C                   ENDIF                                                  BLARQ# IFNE 0
     C     EAPODT        DOWLT     BSD(B)
     C     EAPODT        ANDGE     BSD(A)
     C     *IN60         ANDEQ     '0'
