     C                   Z-ADD     QQDT          SRDTE
     C                   Z-ADD     QQDT          SRDTI
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         WKD(T)
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C                   ADD       7             XXCNT
     C                   ENDDO                                                  XXCNT IFLT
     C*
     C* BILL WEEKLY INSTALLMENTS INTO A/R, CATCHING UP TO CURRENT DATE
     C* IF NECESSARY.
     C*
